{"4364080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Psionic Machinist", "steam_appid": 4364080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlimited Firepower</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a mechanical engineer who accidentally awakens psionic powers, allowing you to command weapons remotely with your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon in your inventory joins the fight under psionic control—there are no spatial limits. As long as you have enough psionic energy, you can deploy as many weapons as you want, turning the battlefield into a storm of automated fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/2704faabfae26b377e39a06c4da79a3a.poster.avif?t=1774592796\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/2704faabfae26b377e39a06c4da79a3a.webm?t=1774592796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/2704faabfae26b377e39a06c4da79a3a.mp4?t=1774592796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a master of mechanics, you can freely modify and synthesize weapons. Every weapon can be combined, upgraded, and transformed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations during each run, discover new weapon recipes, and forge powerful synergies. With countless possible outcomes, no two builds ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/ba197054965c8ea8e9c201c49fc7aa0a.poster.avif?t=1774592796\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/ba197054965c8ea8e9c201c49fc7aa0a.webm?t=1774592796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/ba197054965c8ea8e9c201c49fc7aa0a.mp4?t=1774592796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Inspiration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you earn experience points to unlock and upgrade your Inspiration Circuits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each circuit grants a unique active or passive ability—and some fundamentally change how your weapons are controlled. By equipping different Inspiration Circuits, you unlock entirely new combat mechanics and radically different playstyles.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlimited Firepower</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a mechanical engineer who accidentally awakens psionic powers, allowing you to command weapons remotely with your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon in your inventory joins the fight under psionic control—there are no spatial limits. As long as you have enough psionic energy, you can deploy as many weapons as you want, turning the battlefield into a storm of automated fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/2704faabfae26b377e39a06c4da79a3a.poster.avif?t=1774592796\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/2704faabfae26b377e39a06c4da79a3a.webm?t=1774592796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/2704faabfae26b377e39a06c4da79a3a.mp4?t=1774592796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a master of mechanics, you can freely modify and synthesize weapons. Every weapon can be combined, upgraded, and transformed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations during each run, discover new weapon recipes, and forge powerful synergies. With countless possible outcomes, no two builds ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/ba197054965c8ea8e9c201c49fc7aa0a.poster.avif?t=1774592796\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/ba197054965c8ea8e9c201c49fc7aa0a.webm?t=1774592796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/extras/ba197054965c8ea8e9c201c49fc7aa0a.mp4?t=1774592796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Inspiration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you earn experience points to unlock and upgrade your Inspiration Circuits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each circuit grants a unique active or passive ability—and some fundamentally change how your weapons are controlled. By equipping different Inspiration Circuits, you unlock entirely new combat mechanics and radically different playstyles.</p>", "short_description": "A survivor-like auto-shooter focused on weapon synthesis. Command dozens of weapons with psionic power, apply mechanical expertise to forge super weapons, and mow down massive hordes in unique ways every run. Upgrade your Inspiration Circuits to unlock brand-new combat mechanics.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/c8ce267e97289c82a1e173625a86beb4f17c97ce/header.jpg?t=1774592796", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/dd9ea541e437ef99d03639d574c35cd6c883d29b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774592796", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/dd9ea541e437ef99d03639d574c35cd6c883d29b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774592796", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3/AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 750/AMD Radeon R7 260x<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5/AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 4060/AMD Radeon RX 7600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Copyright Zodiac GameLab. All Rights Reserved.", "developers": ["Zodiac GameLab"], "publishers": ["Zodiac GameLab"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4364080/